WEBVTT

00:20:28.833 --> 00:20:31.101
AG: Alexi knew
that pro athletes and actors

00:20:31.125 --> 00:20:32.393
always have coaches

00:20:32.417 --> 00:20:34.226
and some executives do, too.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.934
Experiments show that when
managers work with coaches,

00:20:36.958 --> 00:20:38.434
their performance improves

00:20:38.458 --> 00:20:40.542
and so does their confidence
and resilience.

00:20:41.417 --> 00:20:43.518
Alexi wanted to bring
more coaches like Heidi

00:20:43.542 --> 00:20:45.268
to professionals everywhere,

00:20:45.292 --> 00:20:47.792
no matter what level they were
in their organization.

00:20:48.708 --> 00:20:52.226
Today, Alexi is the cofounder
and CEO of BetterUp,

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.976
a leading mobile coaching platform

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.726
where tens of thousands
of professionals around the world

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.184
are getting coached everyday.

00:20:58.208 --> 00:21:00.601
They report that it enhances
their job performance